+ * FIRST write of a deal, updated in place, lifted after `min(3, writable)` writes, and never
+ * seen again on that board. Four of the rows below were the pass-2 critique's open findings —
+ * the lesson taught twice after an undo, the lesson that never lifted on a stalled board, the
+ * phantom fourth fill on a leashed deal, the resurrection on a clear — so each is written as
+ * the reader's own sequence rather than as an assertion about a flag.
